; Sylara (Godot 4.x rebuild) — karakter modular:
;   SylaraSkeleton (root: state + blending + drive API)
;   ├── Renderer  — _draw() prosedural berlapis (SylaraRenderer.gd)
;   └── SkillFX   — sequencer FX skill via VFXManager pooled (SylaraSkillFX.gd)
; Animasi prosedural dihitung SylaraAnimator.gd (pose target per state);
; tidak ada Polygon2D/node-per-tulang — satu CanvasItem per karakter
; supaya ringan di Android. Flip facing dilakukan PARENT (Hero/Visual),
; rig selalu digambar menghadap +x.

[node name="SylaraSkeleton" type="Node2D" groups=["sylara_skeleton"]]
script = ExtResource("1_sylara")

